{"title": "Voice of Command", "pageid": 38152, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Voice_of_Command", "categories": ["Bonus actions", "Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp/300px-Generic_Utility.webp, /w/images/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp/300px-Generic_Utility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Voice of Command</b> is a bonus action that allows a target to use Bane's Wrath.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Command an ally in the Dark Lord's name, letting them channel <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane%27s_Wrath\" title=\"Bane's Wrath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/38px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/50px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane's Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane%27s_Wrath\" title=\"Bane's Wrath\">Bane's Wrath</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></span> </dd>         <dt> Details: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft) </dd><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> </dd>\n</dl>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Bane.27s_Command\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bane's_Command\">Condition: Bane's Command</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane%27s_Command_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane's Command (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane's Command\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane%27s_Command_(Condition)\" title=\"Bane's Command (Condition)\">Bane's Command</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This creature can channel <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane%27s_Wrath\" title=\"Bane's Wrath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/38px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/50px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane's Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane%27s_Wrath\" title=\"Bane's Wrath\">Bane's Wrath</a> - it is the Black Hand's will.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Chadd\" title=\"Chadd\">Chadd</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Garmin\" title=\"Garmin\">Garmin</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hertvor_Dremble\" title=\"Hertvor Dremble\">Hertvor Dremble</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Consul_of_Bane\" title=\"Iron Consul of Bane\">Iron Consul of Bane</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jaxbock\" title=\"Jaxbock\">Jaxbock</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Liadan\" title=\"Liadan\">Liadan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lo\" title=\"Lo\">Lo</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Maeve\" title=\"Maeve\">Maeve</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mian\" title=\"Mian\">Mian</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Nuff\" title=\"Nuff\">Nuff</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wulf\" title=\"Wulf\">Wulf</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Yoonce\" title=\"Yoonce\">Yoonce</a>\n</p>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Unused images</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 122px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Voice_of_Command.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Tooltip image\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Voice_of_Command.webp/180px-Voice_of_Command.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Voice_of_Command.webp/270px-Voice_of_Command.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Voice_of_Command.webp/360px-Voice_of_Command.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tooltip image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Voice_of_Command.webp/180px-Voice_of_Command.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Voice_of_Command.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Tooltip image</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 122px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Voice_of_Command_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Controller icon\"><picture><img alt=\"Controller icon\" src=\"/w/images/7/73/Voice_of_Command_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Voice_of_Command_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\